{"id":878564,"title":"08｜Dify一键私有化部署","content":"Dify是一个开源的企业级AI Agent开发平台，支持私有化部署和接入企业内部的大模型。它与字节跳动的Coze类似，都提供聊天Agent、插件式Agent搭建及Workflow模式。本课程首先介绍Dify的私有化部署方法，包括使用Sealos云端容器化平台和传统的Linux加docker-compose方式。Sealos是一种高效的容器化服务部署工具，用户只需充值并选择合适的应用进行一键部署。在Sealos平台上，找到应用商店中的AI分类，选择Dify后填写密码即可开始部署。整个过程类似于在虚拟机中执行docker-compose up，但更加简便快捷。部署完成后，系统会生成一个HTTPS二级域名供访问。通过该地址登录，并设置邮箱账号和密码完成初始化配置，从而实现Dify的私有化部署。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401788,"user_name":"Geek_ea2c65","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4309690,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"8C31D75DFBFC6D","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753798500,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"其实用docker部署的话还是很快的。","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":405389,"user_name":"呆呆","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1080744,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"37058F759D6731","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/7d/a8/22ca33bb.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1771429994,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"https:&#47;&#47;sealos.run&#47; 还是 https:&#47;&#47;cloud.sealos.io&#47;","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":402898,"user_name":"杏林君","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1773407,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"9915CB432073BB","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83erbmQxAz3RgFjquBMYabsJsk0516JibqYWb5SUCFSPoOKueRaFbON6Tn2OhyYgia9tcibEKSYY8yxAiag/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1760355216,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"部署后在输入管理初始化密码那一步一直提示初始化验证失败","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401966,"user_name":"Black船长","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2016786,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"B0B73E8DEB56C4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/